<urn:atm:triage:finding/SMK-005>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "SMK-005" ;
  triage:title "No nudge handoff/re-prompt is recorded in any observable diagnostic surface" ;
  triage:description "fenix (ATM 01M2B4STTJ43RE7XY9WA1FRHM4, 2026-09-12T15:46:58Z), found while root-causing the SMK-004 'rogue' nudge investigation. Reconstructing why team-lead's nudge-test-2 receipt arrived >=1 min after all three test tasks closed required direct reads of mail_message_states + task_events (undocumented, internal tables) -- no nudge handoff or 60s re-prompt (TASK_REMINDER_INTERVAL_MS) is recorded anywhere in a supported diagnostic surface: `atm log filter` (jsonl) had only CLI command records for the window, `--source timeline` returned nothing after 11:25Z, and the launchd stderr log had stopped on 2026-09-07. A handoff record per emitted nudge (member, message_id, kind, attempt) in the diagnostic timeline would have answered this investigation in one query instead of a manual join across two internal tables. Minor; operator/diagnostic tooling gap, not a correctness defect." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
